@HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Upload a CSV (Date;ExecutionTime;Value)
POST {{HostAddress}}/api/data/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.csv"
Content-Type: text/csv

Date;ExecutionTime;Value
2024-01-01T10:00:00Z;1.5;10
2024-01-01T10:00:05Z;2.0;20
--boundary--

### Filtered, paginated results
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/data/results?pageNumber=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Last 10 values for a file
GET {{HostAddress}}/api/data/values/last?fileName=sample.csv
Accept: application/json

###
